config FINGERPRINT_GOODIX_LENOVO
	tristate "Goodix TEE fingerprint sensor (Lenovo TB371FC)"
	depends on INPUT_FINGERPRINT && !FINGERPRINT_GOODIX && !FINGERPRINT_GOODIX_FOD
	help
	  Platform driver for the Goodix side-key fingerprint sensor used on
	  the Lenovo TB371FC. The sensor itself is driven over SPI from the
	  TEE; this driver owns its supply, reset and interrupt lines and
	  exposes /dev/goodix_fp plus the netlink event channel used by the
	  Goodix fingerprint HAL.

	  If unsure, say N.
